    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπτ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>roasting, frying,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλάγχνων,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρεῶν ἕψησις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				57.34
			</span></i> (Milet. <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				381a23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>baking,</i> of bread, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.10.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.109c
			</span></i> (pl.); of pottery, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				1143.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.Es</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>overheating</i> of humours, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.335
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.580
			</span></i>.</div>
